{
  "name": "env-memory-diagnostics",
  "about": "PILOTDECK_MEMORY_DIAGNOSTICS=1（gateway/memoryDiagnostics.ts:22-28，与 gateway.memoryDiagnostics 任一为真即开；cli/createLocalGateway.ts:795-833、cli/GatewayRuntimeRefreshBundle.ts:118、151）：每轮结束等时机往服务进程 stdout 打一行 \"[pilotdeck:memory] {JSON}\"（memoryDiagnostics.ts:58-74：event、进程内存五项、sessionCount / projectKey / reason、session 摘要）。用 serve 起服务比 stdout；内存五项由比较器第 22 条抹成 <mem>，其余照比。一轮纯文本，再一轮读文件（带工具结果，session 摘要里的估算字节数随之变）。 两轮都给定 runId：诊断行里带 runId，随机的 runId 会让 UUID 的出现序号整体错位。 现状不一致（2026-11-14）：Rust 没有实现内存诊断，服务 stdout 里没有这两行。",
  "server": false,
  "files": {
    "proj/notes.txt": "memo\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Mem\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "m2-after",
      "when": [
        "m2:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_m2\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Read it."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "m2",
      "when": [
        "m2:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_m2",
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "path": "{PROJECT}/notes.txt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "m1",
      "when": [
        "m1:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Hello."
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "serve": [
        "server"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PILOTDECK_MEMORY_DIAGNOSTICS": "1"
      },
      "then": [
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-mem",
            "channelKey": "test",
            "message": "m1: hi",
            "runId": "run-m1"
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-mem",
            "channelKey": "test",
            "message": "m2: read",
            "runId": "run-m2"
          },
          "timeout": 20000
        },
        {
          "sleep": 800
        },
        {
          "disconnect": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
